<title>UK: Two people injured in bomb explosion in London.</title>
<headline>Two people injured in bomb explosion in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two people were injured on Monday in a bomb explosion in the basement of an office building in west London, police said.</p>
<p>The device was believed to be a letter bomb. The office building houses an Arab newspaper.  </p>
<p>One of the people injured in the blast received face and abdominal injuries while the second received minor injuries, a spokesman for the ambulance service said.</p>
<p>The offices in Kensington house the Al Hayat newspaper publishing company and a number of other businesses.</p>
</text>
